{"title":"Career roadmap — Visual Merchandiser","role":"Visual Merchandiser","summary":"A Visual Merchandiser designs and manages how products, stores, displays, windows, signage, layouts, and retail environments look and function to attract customers and increase sales.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Retail Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA Retail Management graduate, the strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Retail","Consumer Psychology","Visual Design","Merchandising","Sales Analytics","Store Technology"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Visual Merchandising Executive / Retail VM Executive; build display, styling, store-layout and merchandising skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Senior Visual Merchandiser / VM Specialist; manage stores, campaigns and seasonal launches"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Visual Merchandising Manager / Retail Experience Manager / Brand VM Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Head of Visual Merchandising / Retail Experience Director / Brand Experience Leader"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Retail + visual foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retail management"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Retail marketing"},{"text":"Principles of merchandising"},{"text":"Store operations"},{"text":"Fashion/product fundamentals"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Design principles"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Brand identity"},{"text":"Customer psychology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drawing/sketching basics"},{"text":"Presentation ski